{"step_index":432,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-15T01:15:39Z","thinking":"Publisher registration is handled by municipal district offices; in Yeongdo-gu specifically, it is the Culture and Tourism Division (or Lifelong Education Division). Considering a specific publisher name, potential search terms include \"publisher\" or \"publishing\" in conjunction with the name. Doubting this, it's also necessary to consider whether the name could represent an author, particularly if the author is based in Busan.\n\n\nThe limited data suggests this could be a sole proprietor publisher, possibly an author self-publishing books to obtain an ISBN. This type of publisher often registers only basic information with the local district office, and detailed address is not always recorded or may be masked. The absence of additional business registration details supports this hypothesis.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"search_web","args":{"query":"\"site:nl.go.kr \\\"윤서하\\\"\"","toolAction":"\"국립중앙도서관 저자/출판사 검색 중\"","toolSummary":"\"국립중앙도서관 윤서하 검색\""}}]}
